            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Boethius</strong><br>\nAnicius Manlius Severinus Boethius was born around 477 AD into an aristocratic Roman family. His father was a consul, but he died when Boethius was young. He was then adopted by another illustrious figure, Quintus Aurelius Memmius Symmachus. Under his care, Boethius received a comprehensive education, learning Greek and Roman literature, philosophy, and mathematics, which were the underpinning of his future works.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Career</strong><br>\nBoethius's intelligence and lineage helped him rise to a high position in the Ostrogothic Kingdom in Italy. He became a consul in 510 AD under Theodoric the Great, the Ostrogothic king. His talents were recognized, and he was put in charge of many administrative and senatorial functions, which he executed with a sense of justice and equity that was noted by his contemporaries.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Philosophical Works</strong><br>\nBoethius's most significant contributions were to philosophy and theology. He intended to translate all the works of Plato and Aristotle into Latin and to reconcile their philosophies. Although he did not complete this vast project, his translations and commentaries on logic, arithmetic, and theology were crucial in preserving classical knowledge for later generations.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
